                <div style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#94a3b8' }}>浅层互动，反映内容吸引力</div>
              </div>
              <div style={{ padding: '10px 12px', background: '#fff', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #f59e0b' }}>
                <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#64748b', fontWeight: 600 }}>收藏占比</div>
